    /// Submit an existing product as a response to a specific opportunity lead. The product must belong to the authorized shop and be in `ACTIVATE` status. It will be linked to the opportunity and enter the standard submission review flow.  If you need a new local product, call the [Create Product API](https://partner.tiktokshop.com/docv2/page/create-product-202309) with `save_mode=LISTING`, use the returned `data.product_id`, and wait until the product reaches `ACTIVATE`. A product saved with `save_mode=AS_DRAFT` is not yet eligible. For a global seller that has not migrated to local replication, first call the [Create Global Product API](https://partner.tiktokshop.com/docv2/page/6509de61bace3e02b7489cba) to get a `global_product_id`, then call the [Publish Global Product API](https://partner.tiktokshop.com/docv2/page/publish-global-product-202309). From `data.products`, select the local product `id` for the authorized shop and wait until that product reaches `ACTIVATE` before submitting it here.  After submission, use the [Get Submission Records API](https://partner.tiktokshop.com/docv2/page/get-submission-records-202604) and filter by `opportunity_id` or `product_id` to track the review outcome.
